# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:843
translate fr ev_KrishanaDay_dinner_c8d17a3a:

    # "For the rest of the evening, I sat down with [regina_ref!t] and Erika to enjoy the hot feast prepared, chatting and laughing together as the world outside didn't seem to matter."
    "Pour le reste de la soirée, je me suis assis avec [regina_ref!t] et Erika pour profiter du festin chaud préparé, discutant et riant ensemble comme si le monde extérieur n'avait plus d'importance."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:844
translate fr ev_KrishanaDay_dinner_e6ac4c58:

    # "For just a few hours, we were together, we were happy, and the war and all of its horrors seemed so very far away."
    "Pendant quelques heures, nous étions ensemble, nous étions heureux, et la guerre et toutes ses horreurs semblaient si lointaines."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:845
translate fr ev_KrishanaDay_dinner_54157c65:

    # "I think I know that these days can't last forever, some terrible darkness I can feel draws ever closer, and the endless battles and wars still rage on outside."
    "Je crois savoir que ces jours ne peuvent pas durer éternellement, une terrible obscurité que je sens se rapproche de plus en plus, et les batailles et les guerres sans fin font toujours rage dehors."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:846
translate fr ev_KrishanaDay_dinner_e9195ccb:

    # "I somehow know, I will end up caught in the crosswinds of it's blaze."
    "Je sais d'une manière ou d'une autre que je finirai pris dans les vents contraires de son brasier."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:847
translate fr ev_KrishanaDay_dinner_391c37b3:

    # "I knew, there were more battles to come."
    "Je savais qu'il y aurait d'autres batailles à venir."

# game/data/world_events/novaras/KrishanaEvent/ev_krishana_day.rpy:849
translate fr ev_KrishanaDay_dinner_540147d8:

    # "...But what the hell's the point of spending your life fighting if you just end up alone in the end?"
    "...Mais à quoi bon passer sa vie à se battre si l'on finit seul au final ?"

